      "name": "support-triage",
      "size": "medium",
      "prompt": "Support ticket triage. \"Ticket arrives\" goes to \"Classify\". A billing ticket goes to \"Billing queue\", a technical ticket goes to \"Technical queue\", and anything else goes to \"General queue\". \"Billing queue\" and \"General queue\" both go to \"First response\". \"Technical queue\" goes to \"Reproduce\", which goes to \"First response\" when reproduced and to \"Ask for details\" when not. \"Ask for details\" goes back to \"Reproduce\". \"First response\" goes to \"Resolve\", and \"Resolve\" goes to \"Close\".",
