      "prompt": "The stages of a compiler. \"Source\" goes to \"Lexer\", then \"Parser\", then \"AST\". \"AST\" goes to \"Name resolution\", then \"Type check\". A type error goes to \"Report diagnostics\". A well-typed program goes to \"Lower to IR\", then \"Optimise\", then \"Verify IR\". \"Verify IR\" goes back to \"Optimise\" when it finds a problem and on to \"Code generation\" when it does not. \"Code generation\" goes to \"Object file\".",
