    {
      "name": "payment-settlement",
      "size": "large",
      "prompt": "Card payment settlement. \"Checkout\" goes to \"Create payment intent\", which goes to \"3-D Secure check\". A challenge goes to \"Issuer challenge\", which goes to \"Authorise\" when the customer passes and to \"Decline\" when they fail. No challenge goes straight to \"Authorise\". \"Authorise\" goes to \"Hold funds\" on success and to \"Decline\" on failure. \"Hold funds\" goes to \"Capture\". \"Capture\" goes to \"Settlement batch\", which goes to \"Acquirer payout\", which goes to \"Reconcile ledger\". \"Reconcile ledger\" goes to \"Mismatch alert\" when the totals disagree and to \"Settled\" when they agree. \"Decline\" goes to \"Notify customer\", which goes back to \"Checkout\".",
      "reference": {
        "nodes": [
