    {
      "name": "incident-response",
      "size": "large",
      "prompt": "Incident response. \"Alert fires\" goes to \"Page on-call\". \"Page on-call\" goes to \"Acknowledge\" when answered and to \"Escalate\" when it times out. \"Escalate\" goes to \"Page secondary\", which goes back to \"Acknowledge\". \"Acknowledge\" goes to \"Assess severity\". Severity one goes to \"Open war room\"; anything lower goes to \"Investigate\". \"Open war room\" also goes to \"Investigate\". \"Investigate\" goes to \"Identify cause\", which goes to \"Apply mitigation\". \"Apply mitigation\" goes to \"Verify recovery\". A failed verification goes back to \"Investigate\". A successful one goes to \"Declare resolved\", which goes to \"Write postmortem\", which goes to \"Track action items\".",
